{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610880/extras/030f2e8fbfa3d2af7396d872aaf6ca87.poster.avif?t=1764712286\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610880/extras/030f2e8fbfa3d2af7396d872aaf6ca87.webm?t=1764712286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610880/extras/030f2e8fbfa3d2af7396d872aaf6ca87.mp4?t=1764712286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Dredgeport is spiralling out of control. Gangs rule the slums, corruption trumps the law, and corpses of the war-dead are burned daily for fuel. You are an ex-soldier, mistaken for dead and shipped back to Dredgeport for processing. After a narrow escape, you find yourself alone in the guts of the city, with only two things to your name: your life and your sanity. Keeping both will prove a challenge. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610880/extras/203b505977c1dfddb8133ba7f9bc6959.poster.avif?t=1764712286\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610880/extras/203b505977c1dfddb8133ba7f9bc6959.webm?t=1764712286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610880/extras/203b505977c1dfddb8133ba7f9bc6959.mp4?t=1764712286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Inspired by tabletop RPGs and narrative adventure games like Citizen Sleeper, Duskpunk finds a balance between challenge and freedom, tracking your health, energy and stress as you try to survive. Make lasting choices that determine the city\u2019s fate. Develop skills to distinguish yourself in your chosen field of work. Earn a crust, explore the city, make alliances and escape your traumatic past. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610880/extras/b7e61b1237bcf08a1b1c6787b58bb370.poster.avif?t=1764712286\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610880/extras/b7e61b1237bcf08a1b1c6787b58bb370.webm?t=1764712286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610880/extras/b7e61b1237bcf08a1b1c6787b58bb370.mp4?t=1764712286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Dredgeport plays host to characters with rich backstories and murky motivations. Some care for you or the city; others are in it for themselves, but will pay well. Choose your allies wisely. They will be part of your fate whether you like it or not.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610880/extras/56da383df0aca006e0ec44200a3415ed.avif?t=1764712286\" width=616 height=200 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Meet Brother Rejchek","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2610880/81dde85d2a33be5a74cb5e3254684de39e011fb6.jpg"},{"name":"Face the plasm-yards","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2610880/c878d9e861a19ea47147e852bab28a53b85c3a1d.jpg"},{"name":"Find a solace dealer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2610880/7eb896ebcd9f6d98ea616e38b2ffac728bf3a443.jpg"},{"name":"Steal the draft lists","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2610880/461180b19305a230d0c973e386d10a7b418f98f7.jpg"},{"name":"Witness the founding of the War Dead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2610880/e2535dc31d12aace9b82af2a140ce75db91d5bd2.jpg"},{"name":"Free the War Dead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2610880/a274e0f7a4ff26ee365d14fdef5a20ae0cdd5a09.jpg"},{"name":"Join a revolutionary conspiracy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2610880/0cb22a80bd3892bd7608139f166ff68d09d3b385.jpg"},{"name":"Win a battle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2610880/1fa055fbbccf75fd49ce40efda427a67b4c03c97.jpg"},{"name":"Survive the uprising","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2610880/3dc05d99bbb89291d51f8114b6b753528a9015c7.jpg"},{"name":"Gain Zai's allegiance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2610880/d85bba47e5c1d25ca8128f31f8f251512e085445.jpg"}],"total":33},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2610880?t=1764712286","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610880/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764712286","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610880/000b81fbce9f1b01a19ee1720a6c76d81f7218aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764712286","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610880/000b81fbce9f1b01a19ee1720a6c76d81f7218aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764712286","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"All mature content is expressed via text, not images. This game tells stories about the most desperate members of society who are forced to steal, fight and beg just to get by. The main character is haunted by trauma from war and must use illegally obtained drugs to self-medicate."},"demos":[{"appid":2802420,"description":""}],"detai